<title>USA: TCI Satellite satellite launch set.</title>
<headline>TCI Satellite satellite launch set.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>TCI Satellite Entertainment Inc said on Wednesday the launch of its high-powered TEMPO satellite is scheduled for Thursday at 0102 EST/0602 GMT.</p>
<p>An early morning Wednesday launch was cancelled when a main battery had to be replaced, but the launch vehicle and spacecraft are ready for flight, the company said.</p>
</text>
